The project explored how game mechanics could make that learning more motivating. Instead of treating soft skills as separate from the student journey, Nudge built them into an experience that rewards participation, progress, and self-improvement, making workforce preparation feel less intimidating.

The result was a concept that uses design to bridge education and workforce readiness in a way that feels human, motivating, and relevant.
